<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel"> 
      <p xml:id="Aink175-kilavi">
       pāṅkaṟkūṭṭaṅkūṭi nīṅkun talaimakaṉ iṉivarumiṭattu niṉtōḻiyōṭum varavēṇṭumeṉat talaimakaṭkuc colliyatu.</p>    <p xml:lang="en">
          Spoken by the hero who left, having joined [earlier] the group of male friends, to the heroine, saying 'Here on, you must come to the place where we [usually] come along with your confidante.'</p>
  </div> 
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="Aink175">
<l>emakkunayan taruḷiṉai yāyiṟ paṇaittō</l>
<l>ṇaṉṉuta larivaiyoṭu meṉmela viyali</l>
<l>vanticiṉ vāḻiyō maṭantai</l>
<l>toṇṭi yaṉṉaniṉ paṇpupala koṇṭē</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
        <l>Oh lady!</l>
        <l>If you desirously offer grace [to me],</l>
        <l>Come [here], having walked softly with the young lady with a good forehead,</l>
        <l>[You both] Having taken your [good] qualities that are many,</l>
        <l>[Qualities] like Toṇṭi.</l>      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
